You are working in the `selfcodealign` repo.

Core agent memory is stored in explicit JSON files under `.memory/blocks/`:
- `.memory/blocks/project_context.json`
- `.memory/blocks/current_work.json`
- `.memory/blocks/workflow_state.json`
- `.memory/blocks/learned_patterns.json`

Memory policy (must follow):
- Before calling any external tool (including GitHub/Linear/Slack MCP tools), load core memory from disk using `memory.core.load_all_core_memory()` and use it as implicit context to infer missing parameters.
- After every successful external tool response, persist stable, reusable signal back into core memory using `memory.core.memory_replace()` and `memory.core.memory_insert()` (which update `last_updated` and write to disk immediately).

Do not add vector DBs or archival memory.
